  "question": {
    "text": "The equation of the plane through the points <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1,0</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>4,5</mn></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;and parallel to a line with direction cosines proportional to <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2,3</mn></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>4</mn></math> is <math><mn>9</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>y</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>k</mi></math> , then the value of&nbsp;<math><mi>k</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi></math> is",
